# REKA AI Scanner & Legal Disclosure Configuration (optional)
#
# The app works fully offline without these values: manual entry never leaves the device.
# Scanning receipts or e-Statements is the only feature that sends data over the network.
#
# Option A — RECOMMENDED for CBT, shared, and Play Store / App Store builds
# Deploy `workers/gemini-proxy` to Cloudflare Workers Free and point REKA at it so
# GEMINI_API_KEY stays strictly on the server and is never embedded in the APK/IPA.
# Remove EXPO_PUBLIC_GEMINI_API_KEY completely from EAS when using Option A.
#
# EXPO_PUBLIC_GEMINI_PROXY_URL=https://reka-gemini-proxy.your-subdomain.workers.dev
# EXPO_PUBLIC_GEMINI_PROXY_TOKEN=optional-random-cbt-token
#
# Option B — Local developer testing only (NEVER ship shared/CBT/Store builds with this!)
# Any EXPO_PUBLIC_* value is inlined into the JavaScript bundle and can be extracted
# from an APK/IPA even when marked "Sensitive" in EAS.
# EXPO_PUBLIC_GEMINI_API_KEY=
#
# Optional store-compliance links displayed in Settings -> Privacy & Data
# EXPO_PUBLIC_PRIVACY_POLICY_URL=https://example.com/privacy
# EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPPORT_EMAIL=support@example.com
